Package: rks98-studio
Version: @VERSION@-6
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: RK-S98 Studio contributors
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libudev1, libgl1, libegl1, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xkb1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-render0, libxcb-shm0, libxcb-sync1, libxcb-xfixes0, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: RGB lighting and display controls for the Royal Kludge RK-S98
 Independent, experimental wired USB configurator with a Qt desktop interface.
 Bundles Python and Qt. Direct hardware writes may damage the device.
